<view class="page">
  <view class="title">设置</view>

  <view class="tabs">
    <view class="tab tab-active">房间管理</view>
  </view>

  <view class="preview-banner" wx:if="{{previewMode}}">
    UI Preview · 管理操作暂不写入服务器
  </view>

  <view class="section">
    <view class="section-title">房间成员</view>

    <view class="member-row" wx:for="{{participants}}" wx:key="id">
      <view>
        <view class="member-name">
          {{item.name}}
          <text wx:if="{{item.id === ownerId}}" class="owner-label">房主</text>
        </view>
        <view class="member-meta">{{item.ready ? "已准备" : "未准备"}}</view>
      </view>

      <view class="member-actions" wx:if="{{item.id !== ownerId}}">
        <button
          size="mini"
          data-player-id="{{item.id}}"
          bindtap="onTransferOwnerTap"
        >
          移交房主
        </button>
        <button
          size="mini"
          type="warn"
          data-player-id="{{item.id}}"
          bindtap="onKickTap"
        >
          移出
        </button>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="footnote">
    Room Owner 与游戏主持人是独立职责；移交房主不会改变说书人/法官 assignment。
  </view>
</view>
